          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Fiji's Saturday opponents Ireland lose captain Dan Sheehan to concussion",
          "body": "The IRFU confirmed on Monday that hooker Dan Sheehan will miss Saturday's match at the Aviva Stadium. The 28-year-old was forced off for a head injury assessment just before half-time in Friday's 42-12 win over Argentina and is in a 12-day return-to-play protocol. Gus McCarthy has been called in to train with the squad, and Sheehan, who was captain in the absence of the injured Caelan Doris, is a doubt for the South Africa game."
