      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Player response",
          "heading": "Jack van Poortvliet says England played with 'extra edge' for Steve Borthwick",
          "body": "Jack van Poortvliet has admitted that the week's criticism of Steve Borthwick in the broadsheets found its way into England's performance against Australia. The scrum-half said the playing group and staff had held a conversation about it and backed the head coach, adding: \"there was an extra edge to do well for Steve\". He also looked back on a difficult first half, when a Max Jorgensen intercept led to a try, before a Tommy Freeman pass sent him clear for his own score straight after the break."
        },
