    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Erasmus tips Kalvin Gourgues to start at flyhalf for France",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié is short of flyhalves after Romain Ntamack injured his shoulder against Fiji, and South Africa coach Rassie Erasmus reckons the France coach will pick a more physical 10 this week. He anticipates 21-year-old centre Kalvin Gourgues starting at flyhalf, with scrum-half Maxime Lucu, who has played 10 for Bordeaux Bègles and France, coming off the bench once the game opens up. Dupont, who is set to lead Les Bleus, adds a wildcard, because Erasmus admits he is not sure his teammates always know what the skipper will do next."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa beat Italy 66-7",
