    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Dan Sheehan out of Fiji game; Sean Jansen ruled out of championship",
          "body": "Dan Sheehan will miss Saturday's Nations Championship game against Fiji after a concussion suffered against Argentina, with the IRFU confirming a 12-day return-to-play protocol. The captain was forced off for a head injury assessment just before half-time on Friday and never returned. Sean Jansen is out of the rest of the championship with a knee injury, and returns to Connacht for rehabilitation. Leinster's Gus McCarthy and Ulster's David McCann have been called in to train with the squad this week."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa beat Italy 66-7",
