    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad update",
          "heading": "Marco Riccioni returns to Italy squad for Argentina test in Genoa",
          "body": "Marco Riccioni is available again for Saturday's Argentina test in Genoa, the Perpignan prop with 39 caps rejoining the squad. The group stays in Turin before travelling to Genoa on Thursday. Niccolò Cannone, the Benetton second-row, said after the Springboks defeat that Italy must bring everything that failed in Turin and take a step forward in every area."
        },
