      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection debate",
          "heading": "Tom Shanklin wants Dan Edwards to replace Sam Costelow at 10",
          "body": "Sam Costelow started the 28-21 win over Japan, with Dan Edwards coming off the bench in the second half, and former Wales centre Tom Shanklin says Edwards should start against New Zealand. \"I'd go with Dan Edwards at 10,\" said Shanklin, who wants more ball movement from the fly-half against the All Blacks. Former scrum-half Richie Rees and ex-wing Shane Williams disagree, urging head coach Steve Tandy to keep Costelow for continuity, with Williams warning a switch could strip Costelow of confidence."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa beat Italy 66-7",
