      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Contepomi adds two hookers and Medrano to Pumas squad for Genoa",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi has been forced to shuffle his group before Saturday's test in Genoa. Matías Medrano, uncapped and at Benetton this season, replaces Rodrigo Martínez, while hookers Facundo Bosch and Bautista Bernasconi also come in; Bosch's last cap was in 2021. The changes follow the 42-12 defeat in Dublin, where Julián Montoya failed an HIA and Leonel Oviedo, both in doubt for Italy, were tested several times. Tobías Wade replaces Juan Cruz Mallía at fullback after a sprained knee."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa beat Italy 66-7",
