      "edition": "Tuesday 10 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Les Kiss signals Scotland changes; Carter Gordon, Tom Hooper in contention",
          "body": "Head coach Les Kiss says he is set to change his matchday squad for the Scotland Test after the 45-22 loss to England, and the selection process is under review. Carter Gordon and Tom Hooper, recovered from injury, are candidates to return, while Rob Valetini, Ben Donaldson and Filipo Daugunu impressed off the bench at Twickenham. Kiss said: \"We want competition and it hasn't been good enough, so we've got to look at that closely for sure.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa beat Italy 66-7",
